{
    "text": " Okay, so the core idea of this project, titled The Fourth Wall, is to create a game that is about its own creation. But since the creative process happens mostly inside of my own head, I wanted to make my thoughts kind of flow directly into the game world. In this first simple prototype, my spoken words appear as pieces of a walkway, allowing you, the player, to literally follow my thought process by walking on them one by one as they appear. And I recognize that there isn't much interesting gameplay here yet, but you know, I had to start somewhere and I'm quite optimistic about what we have so far. So now I'm gonna spawn a portal that will take you to the next update. See you there!",
